{
  "name": "@local/dsh-fish-friends",
  "version": "0.5.1",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "鱼友簿：记朋友、算亲密度、按内容找该发给谁；多个总台轮流接、桥接收发、三次自动建档建专属会话、限流与主动闲聊；公共场合聊熟自动转私聊、朋友作息分析、每日交友目标提醒（可按总台开关）；新会话自动交接记忆；带朋友圈面板（侧栏入口）。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "main": "./host.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./host.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "host.js",
    "client.js",
    "lib/*.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots"
      ]
    }
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "friends",
    "affinity",
    "share",
    "bridge",
    "inbox",
    "briefing"
  ]
}
